  "body_html": "<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">Extend your virtual reality sessions with a spare headset battery. Lets you continue using your VIVE Focus Vision1 or VIVE Focus 3 while its main battery is charging. The swappable battery design enables easy charging for all-day VR headset use.</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">1. VIVE Focus Vision has a built-in reserve battery, allowing you to swap the VIVE Battery for Focus Series in the rear battery case without losing power for up to 20 minutes.</div>",
